<title>POLAND: BIG OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.60 vs    8.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    4.60 vs    8.69</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  0.78 vs   20.19</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	31.34 vs   35.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA. October is the first month of the bank's</p>
<p>fiscal year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
